[statement]
Of two versions of one package providing a name at one version, apk
installs the later, whatever their priorities: `c` 3 provides `w` at 3 as
`c` 1 does with a priority of 100, and `c` 3 is installed for `w`.

[repository]
P:c
V:3
p:w=3

P:c
V:1
k:100
p:w=3

[request]
w

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install c 3
